<title>INDONESIA: INDNONESIA'S LIPPO BANK H1 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>INDNONESIA'S LIPPO BANK H1 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's privately-owned PT Lippo Bank said on Tuesday it posted a net profit of 87.2 billion rupiah in the first six months of this year, up 58.8 percent in the same 1996 period.</p>
</text>
